  {
   "id": "H-3wDE34yU6vmf2QAhEqC",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2950,
   "y": 470.0,
   "width": 286.6568000000001,
   "height": 360.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#343a40",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a2",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 179333966,
   "version": 4,
   "versionNonce": 1603359822,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1788498377056,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "THE GAP ESTIMATE\n\n  g(A,B) = min( q05( nn_xz(A -> B) ),\n                q05( nn_xz(B -> A) ) )\n\nSymmetric by construction: the smaller of the two\ndirected fifth-percentile nearest-neighbour\ndistances in the horizontal plane.\n\n  voxel key = floor(x/0.005), floor(z/0.005)\n\nFive millimetres is the quantisation. The voxel\nrepresentative is the highest-confidence pixel,\nties broken by the lowest flat pixel index.\n\n  erosion radius = ceil(max(w_m/w_t, h_m/h_t))\n\nA mask eroded at one scale erodes the same way at\nanother.\n\nConsequence: identical mask and point-map bytes\nselect the same voxels and return the same gap.\nDeterminism here is a property of these three\nrules. It is not a retry policy.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "THE GAP ESTIMATE\n\n  g(A,B) = min( q05( nn_xz(A -> B) ),\n                q05( nn_xz(B -> A) ) )\n\nSymmetric by construction: the smaller of the two\ndirected fifth-percentile nearest-neighbour\ndistances in the horizontal plane.\n\n  voxel key = floor(x/0.005), floor(z/0.005)\n\nFive millimetres is the quantisation. The voxel\nrepresentative is the highest-confidence pixel,\nties broken by the lowest flat pixel index.\n\n  erosion radius = ceil(max(w_m/w_t, h_m/h_t))\n\nA mask eroded at one scale erodes the same way at\nanother.\n\nConsequence: identical mask and point-map bytes\nselect the same voxels and return the same gap.\nDeterminism here is a property of these three\nrules. It is not a retry policy.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "labelPosition": null
  },
  {
   "id": "wNnos-73_wmn_-xr5pVEY",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 60,
   "y": 112.0,
   "width": 1008.1745806451612,
   "height": 18.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
