  {
   "id": "dzEApa8UZ70wQB4upbq9Q",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2950,
   "y": 1035.0,
   "width": 286.2584000000001,
   "height": 345.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#343a40",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a4V",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 543281550,
   "version": 5,
   "versionNonce": 1682635509,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1788498377133,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "THE RESULT BOUNDARY, condensed\n(the exact text is in README Step 5)\n\nFour operational paths ran together. The paths\nwere the scene-graph path, the question-only\nbaseline, the correct-image metric path, and the\nschema-matched shuffled-image metric control.\nEach path produced eight label-free prescore\nprediction rows. The total was 32 rows. The\nexecution, warning-scan, restoration, cleanup,\nand terminal-seal gates passed. The run used zero\nretries. Protected labels and ground truth\nremained sealed. No score or paired comparison\nwas computed. This establishes operational\nintegrity only.\n\nIt does not establish accuracy, superiority over\nanother path or system, a causal or ablation\neffect, statistical significance, an uncertainty\ninterval, calibration, benchmark ranking,\nproduction readiness, a cost or latency result,\nor native SpatialClaw persistent-kernel\nintegration.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "THE RESULT BOUNDARY, condensed\n(the exact text is in README Step 5)\n\nFour operational paths ran together. The paths\nwere the scene-graph path, the question-only\nbaseline, the correct-image metric path, and the\nschema-matched shuffled-image metric control.\nEach path produced eight label-free prescore\nprediction rows. The total was 32 rows. The\nexecution, warning-scan, restoration, cleanup,\nand terminal-seal gates passed. The run used zero\nretries. Protected labels and ground truth\nremained sealed. No score or paired comparison\nwas computed. This establishes operational\nintegrity only.\n\nIt does not establish accuracy, superiority over\nanother path or system, a causal or ablation\neffect, statistical significance, an uncertainty\ninterval, calibration, benchmark ranking,\nproduction readiness, a cost or latency result,\nor native SpatialClaw persistent-kernel\nintegration.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "labelPosition": null
  },
  {
