   "seed": 1820874322,
   "version": 5,
   "versionNonce": 1823241581,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1788498377133,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "ATTRIBUTION AND PUBLICATION STATE\n\nPerception primitives are upstream SpatialClaw\nunder NVIDIA Source Code License-NC. The public\nrepository supplies the bridge, the run modes, the\nmapping contract, and the journal validators. The\ncombined four-path run used a separate private\nexecution environment. The revised manuscript in\npaper/ is not yet on arXiv.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "ATTRIBUTION AND PUBLICATION STATE\n\nPerception primitives are upstream SpatialClaw\nunder NVIDIA Source Code License-NC. The public\nrepository supplies the bridge, the run modes, the\nmapping contract, and the journal validators. The\ncombined four-path run used a separate private\nexecution environment. The revised manuscript in\npaper/ is not yet on arXiv.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "labelPosition": null
  },
  {
   "id": "JSG5uOr3t45MAb4cREfKZ",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 90,
   "y": 286.0,
   "width": 269.52560000000005,
   "height": 210.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#343a40",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a6",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1948890243,
   "version": 3,
   "versionNonce": 1028949613,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1788497881430,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. Answer a spatial question about a worksite\n    image with an inspectable derivation.\n\n2. On the opt-in strict metric path, estimate\n    the gap from masks and a reconstructed\n    point map, or return an explicit\n    unavailable result.\n\n3. Run one frozen question set through four\n    comparison paths without opening a label.\n\nOne sentence: ask about a photo, get an answer\nbuilt from computed facts, and run four\ncomparison paths without opening a label.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "1. Answer a spatial question about a worksite\n    image with an inspectable derivation.\n\n2. On the opt-in strict metric path, estimate\n    the gap from masks and a reconstructed\n    point map, or return an explicit\n    unavailable result.\n\n3. Run one frozen question set through four\n    comparison paths without opening a label.\n\nOne sentence: ask about a photo, get an answer\nbuilt from computed facts, and run four\ncomparison paths without opening a label.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "labelPosition": null
  },
