  {
   "id": "QflGqaaOvwgFwwLf3OcW8",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 90,
   "y": 636.0,
   "width": 276.9039673469389,
   "height": 285.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#343a40",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a9",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 121396109,
   "version": 3,
   "versionNonce": 359583363,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1788497881430,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Determinism: the same masks and point map\ngive the same voxel representatives and the\nsame gap.\n\nFail closed: an unverifiable answer is worse\nthan no answer, so the strict path returns an\nexplicit unavailable result.\n\nLabel isolation: a run must complete and be\ninspected before any label is opened.\n\nProvenance on every value from the strict metric\npath: protocol id, evidence digest, range check.\n\nBelow the line (out of scope)\n  This repository reports no latency result,\n  so it sets no latency budget.\n  Multi-tenancy is out of scope.\n  Autoscaling is out of scope.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Determinism: the same masks and point map\ngive the same voxel representatives and the\nsame gap.\n\nFail closed: an unverifiable answer is worse\nthan no answer, so the strict path returns an\nexplicit unavailable result.\n\nLabel isolation: a run must complete and be\ninspected before any label is opened.\n\nProvenance on every value from the strict metric\npath: protocol id, evidence digest, range check.\n\nBelow the line (out of scope)\n  This repository reports no latency result,\n  so it sets no latency budget.\n  Multi-tenancy is out of scope.\n  Autoscaling is out of scope.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "labelPosition": null
  },
